---
// Hero component: focus on family purpose, peace of mind, and instant reliability
---

<section class="hero-section">
  <div class="container hero-container">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span class="badge-dot"></span>
      <span>Pelindung Lokasi Keluarga Generasi Baru</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-title">
      Ketenangan Pikiran untuk Orang Tua, Perlindungan Nyata untuk Anak
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-subtitle">
      FamLoop membantu keluarga di Indonesia saling menjaga keberadaan secara langsung.
      Hubungkan perangkat anak dalam hitungan detik tanpa perlu email atau sandi rumit.
      Titik lokasi tetap aman tersimpan bahkan saat anak memasuki area tanpa sinyal seluler.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#demo" class="btn btn-primary hero-btn">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon>
        </svg>
        Lihat Simulasi Langsung
      </a>
      <a href="#cara-kerja" class="btn btn-secondary hero-btn">
        Pelajari Cara Kerja
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Key Trust Pillars (R-36, evidence-based, no fake numbers) -->
    <div class="trust-pill-grid">
      <div class="trust-pill">
        <div class="trust-icon">✓</div>
        <div class="trust-text">
          <strong>Tanpa Akun Tambahan</strong>
          <span>Cukup scan QR dari ponsel anak</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-pill">
        <div class="trust-icon">✓</div>
        <div class="trust-text">
          <strong>Offline Buffer Aman</strong>
          <span>Koordinat tersimpan saat sinyal hilang</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-pill">
        <div class="trust-icon">✓</div>
        <div class="trust-text">
          <strong>Tahan Blokir Firewall</strong>
          <span>Tetap aktif di WiFi sekolah dan publik</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-pill">
        <div class="trust-icon">✓</div>
        <div class="trust-text">
          <strong>Privasi Mandiri</strong>
          <span>Data keluarga tidak dibagikan ke pihak ketiga</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, var(--primary-subtle), transparent 60%);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background-color: var(--emerald-subtle);
    color: var(--emerald);
    border: 1px solid var(--emerald);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .badge-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--emerald);
  }

  .hero-title {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .hero-btn {
    padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .trust-pill-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1050px;
  }

  .trust-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    text-align: left;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .trust-pill:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .trust-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--emerald-subtle);
    color: var(--emerald);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: bold;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .trust-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .trust-text strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .trust-text span {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero-section {
      padding-top: 3rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .hero-btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
